    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήνεμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νη-, ἄνεμος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without wind, calm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.556
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				43
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλάνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					740
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1456
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					778
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηνέμους ἔσχεν αἰθὴρ δρόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Limen.
					8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νηνέμοις</span> in
				<i>windless</i> places, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.8.1
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸ -ώτερον εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					373a24
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.). </div>
